Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.96,0:01:07.58,Title,0,0,0,0,,《小鬼当家》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.41,0:01:27.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的行李呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's my suitcase?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.58,0:01:31.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁偷了吹风机？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who stole the hair dryer?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.92,0:01:33.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,哎 小姐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss. Young lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.59,0:01:35.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 小姐们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me. Girls!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.13,0:01:38.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,小家伙 嗨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, little fella. Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.68,0:01:41.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 小姐们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, girls. Girls!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.85,0:01:42.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,哎 胖子！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, big fella!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.01,0:01:45.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我整理客厅的床{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me make the beds in the living room.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.43,0:01:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,下来这里！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on down here!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.85,0:01:48.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,小家伙！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, son!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.69,0:01:53.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,胖子！小家伙！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Big fella. Hey, little guy! Little guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.44,0:01:57.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,彼得的哥哥和他的全家 现在都在这儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pete's brother and his family are here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.40,0:01:58.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,翠丝要去蒙特利尔度假{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trish is going to Montreal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.16,0:02:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,蒙特利尔？噢 她家人在那里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Montreal? Oh, her family's there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.95,0:02:03.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们也放假了 - 你们什么时候走？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Then we're off. - When?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.58,0:02:05.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 明天就走 - 你是不是还没有准备好？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tomorrow. - You're not ready, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.50,0:02:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,法兰克叔叔不让我看电影…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uncle Frank won't let me watch the movie…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.21,0:02:10.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是他让大孩子看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but the big kids can.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.79,0:02:12.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么我就不能看呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why can't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.25,0:02:13.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正在讲电话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm on the phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.38,0:02:16.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们什么时候回来？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When do you come back?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.71,0:02:19.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这部电影又不是限制级 他真讨厌{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not even rated R. He's just being a jerk.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.68,0:02:23.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文 要是法兰克叔叔说不能看…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin, if Uncle Frank says no…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.47,0:02:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那一定是烂片{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…then it must be really bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.39,0:02:28.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我们要把狗送去狗舍里… 嘿 下去！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we put the dog in the kennel… Hey, get off!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.69,0:02:29.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文 出去！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin, out of the room.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.06,0:02:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,挂了电话再来赶我出去啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang up the phone and make me, why don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.56,0:02:33.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,死孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.77,0:02:36.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有没有买电流转换器之类的东西？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you pick up a voltage adapter thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.53,0:02:38.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 我没闲时间买那个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I didn't have time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.28,0:02:41.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那我到法国用什么刮胡子？- 那就留山羊胡啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Then how do I shave in France? - Grow a goatee.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.24,0:02:43.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸 他们什么事都不让我做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad, nobody'll let me do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.58,0:02:47.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找点事给你做 把这里的小东西都收好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got something, pick up those Micro Machines that are all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.08,0:02:50.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你莱丝莉婶婶脖子差点断掉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aunt Leslie almost broke her neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.29,0:02:52.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他又玩热熔胶枪了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was playing with the glue gun again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.04,0:02:54.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们谈过这个了吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We talked about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.50,0:02:57.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有把房子烧掉过吗？没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did I burn down the joint? I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.59,0:02:59.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是用鱼钩做了一个装饰品{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I made ornaments out of fish hooks.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.34,0:03:03.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是用我的新鱼钩做的吧？- 我又不能用旧鱼钩做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My new fish hooks? - I can't make them out of old ones…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.93,0:03:06.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,有干的蚯蚓肠子粘在上面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…with dry worm guts stuck on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.22,0:03:10.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 彼得 - 走吧 凯文 出去吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Peter. - Come on, Kevin. Out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.56,0:03:12.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有电流转换器吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you guys have a voltage adapter?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.85,0:03:14.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里有一个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's a voltage adapter!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.52,0:03:18.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你越来越重了 快去收拾你的行李吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, you're getting heavy! Go pack your suitcase.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.53,0:03:22.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,收拾我的行李？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pack my suitcase?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.95,0:03:25.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 洗发精在哪里？- 我又不住这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where's the shampoo? - I don't live here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.28,0:03:27.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这房子里有这么多人住居然连瓶洗发精都没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This many people here and no shampoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.62,0:03:29.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你父母在家吗？- 他们不住在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are your folks home? - They don't live here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.95,0:03:32.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 崔西 是你叫的披萨吗？- 是巴兹叫的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tracy, did you order the pizza? - Buzz did.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.83,0:03:34.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 你的父母在这里吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me. Are your parents here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.08,0:03:36.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父母住在巴黎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My parents live in Paris.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.71,0:03:37.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好！- 你好！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hi! - Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.96,0:03:39.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你父母在家吗？- 在啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are your parents home? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.51,0:03:41.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们住在这吗？- 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do they live here? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.59,0:03:45.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,全是孩子 没有父母{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Why should they? All kids, no parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.55,0:03:46.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是孤儿院还是什么地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably a fancy orphanage.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.35,0:03:51.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道怎么收拾行李 我这一辈子还从来没有收拾过行李呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know how to pack a suitcase. I've never done it once.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.27,0:03:53.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 厉害啊 - 梅根也是这么说的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tough. - That's what Megan said.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.60,0:03:56.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我说什么？- 你说他厉害{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What did I say? - You told him, "Tough."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.31,0:03:59.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家伙嘀咕行李半天了 我能说什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The dope was whining about a suitcase. What was I supposed to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.82,0:04:01.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,恭喜他 恭喜他是白痴吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Congratulations, you're an idiot"?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.74,0:04:03.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我才不是白痴！- 是吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm not an idiot! - Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.49,0:04:06.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你根本不会照顾自己！什么事都要别人帮你做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're helpless! We have to do everything for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.78,0:04:09.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她说得没错 凯文 - 得了吧 讨厌 我比你小那么多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She's right, Kev. - Excuse me, puke-breath. I'm small.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.20,0:04:11.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不会收拾行李呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know how to pack.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.04,0:04:15.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 希望你别放乱七八糟的东西在行李里 - 闭嘴 琳妮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I hope you didn't just pack crap. - Shut up, Linnie.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.54,0:04:17.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我应该带什么东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know what I should pack?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.26,0:04:20.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴兹叫你多带些卫生纸和水{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buzz told you, cheek-face. Toilet paper and water.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.88,0:04:23.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干嘛这么担心？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you so worried about?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.84,0:04:26.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道 不管怎么样 妈会帮你收拾东西的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know Mom's gonna pack your stuff, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.68,0:04:29.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是法语中说的那种「无能之辈」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're what the French call les incompetents.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.01,0:04:31.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.27,0:04:33.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,投弹啦！躲开！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bombs away!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.11,0:04:41.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来你得和富勒睡一张沙发床了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}P.S. You have to sleep on the hide-a-bed with Fuller.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.03,0:04:45.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,他睡前只要喝点东西就会尿床{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he has something to drink, he'll wet the bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.95,0:04:48.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这房子里这么多人 真烦死人了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This house is so full of people it makes me sick!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.91,0:04:51.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我长大了就结婚 我要自己一个人住！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I grow up and get married, I'm living alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.87,0:04:54.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,听见没有？我要自己住！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you hear me? I'm living alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.42,0:04:57.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要自己住！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm living alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.30,0:05:02.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁来喂你的蜘蛛啊？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's gonna feed your spider?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.05,0:05:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他刚刚吃了很多老鼠内脏 应该能顶几个星期{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He just ate a load of mice guts. He'll be good for a couple weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.55,0:05:11.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,法国妞是不是真的不刮腋毛？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it true French babes don't shave their pits?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.10,0:05:13.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些妞是不刮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.68,0:05:16.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,法国有裸体海滩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they got nude beaches.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.39,0:05:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,冬季没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not in the winter.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.94,0:05:25.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴兹？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buzz?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.65,0:05:27.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会敲门啊？浑蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you know how to knock, phlegm-wad?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.20,0:05:31.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在你的房里睡觉好吗？我不要和富勒一起睡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I sleep here? I don't want to sleep with Fuller.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.62,0:05:33.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他喝点水就尿床{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he drinks, he'll wet the bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.08,0:05:38.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算你长在我的屁股上 我也不会让你睡在我的房间里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't let you sleep in my room if you were growing on my ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.59,0:05:43.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,看外面 是老家伙马利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check it out. Old man Marley.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.68,0:05:48.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是谁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's he?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.51,0:05:52.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,听说过南弯雪锹杀手吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ever heard of the South Bend Shovel Slayer?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.14,0:05:55.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没有 - 就是他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - That's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.22,0:06:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,在1958年 他用铲雪锹把他家人和半数以上的邻居…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In '58 he murdered his whole family and half the people on his block…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.23,0:06:03.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,打死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…with a snow shovel.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.73,0:06:06.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,自从那次事件以后 他就一直隐居在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Been hiding out in this neighborhood ever since.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.94,0:06:10.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是杀人犯 警察干嘛不抓他？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he's the shovel slayer, how come the cops don't arrest him?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.70,0:06:12.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,证据不足 无法定罪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not enough evidence to convict.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.16,0:06:15.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,警察从没有找到过尸体{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They never found the bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.45,0:06:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是这里每个人都知道 是他干的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone around here knows he did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.12,0:06:19.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看他还会杀人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll just be a matter of time…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.17,0:06:22.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,只不过是迟早的问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…before he does it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.42,0:06:24.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,那他现在干嘛？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's he doing now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.25,0:06:27.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他每天夜里都在街上…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He walks up and down the streets every night…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.42,0:06:29.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,走来走去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…salting the sidewalks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.93,0:06:31.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也许是在做好事吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe he's just trying to be nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.64,0:06:35.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.93,0:06:38.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,看那垃圾桶是不是装满了盐？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See that garbage can full of salt?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.14,0:06:41.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,被杀了的人就放在那里面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's where he keeps his victims.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.06,0:06:44.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后盐就把尸体{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The salt turns the bodies…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.15,0:06:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,变成了木乃伊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…into mummies.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.36,0:06:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,木乃伊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mummies!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.45,0:06:56.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让他看见！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.77,0:07:23.59,Note,0,0,0,0,,（小尼罗披萨二十分钟内送达 不然免费）
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.57,0:07:32.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,小朋友你们好吗？很好吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you kids doing? Good?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.61,0:07:34.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天这儿有好多玩的 对不对？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lot of action around here today, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.99,0:07:36.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,去度假吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Going on vacation?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.87,0:07:38.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们去哪儿？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.54,0:07:42.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,听到我说的吗？要去旅行吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hear me, or what? Going on a trip?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.50,0:07:44.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们去哪啊孩子？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where you going, kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.55,0:07:56.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,一共是122块半{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, that's $122.50.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.89,0:07:58.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是我叫的 小子 我不住这{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not from me, kid. I don't live here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.22,0:08:01.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是来过节的吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just around for the holidays?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.39,0:08:02.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,算是吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.89,0:08:04.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 披萨送来了！- 是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Pizza's here! - There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.73,0:08:06.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,一共122块半{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's $122.50.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.90,0:08:08.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我弟弟的家 他会给你钱的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my brother's house. He'll get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.53,0:08:12.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,哎 听我说…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, listen…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.95,0:08:14.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 - 嘿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hi. - Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.57,0:08:16.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是麦卡利斯特先生吗？- 我是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you Mr. McCallister? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.66,0:08:18.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,是住这的麦卡利斯特先生吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Mr. McCallister who lives here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.74,0:08:21.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 披萨一共122块半{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good, because somebody owes me $122.50.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.33,0:08:25.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我想跟你谈谈 - 要抓我还是怎样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'd like a word with you, sir. - Am I under arrest or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.08,0:08:29.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,一般入室抢劫多在节日期间发生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. There's always a lot of burglaries around the holidays.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.25,0:08:30.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们要对周围进行检查{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're checking the neighborhood.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.54,0:08:33.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看大家是不是采取了适当的防范措施{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to see if the proper precautions are taken.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.55,0:08:37.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有装自动照明计时器 每个门也都装有门锁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have automatic timers for our lights, locks for our doors.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.76,0:08:39.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些都是每户人家可以做得到的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's about as well as anybody can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.97,0:08:42.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你喝了蛋酒之类的东西吗？- 走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did you get some eggnog? - Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.27,0:08:43.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 吃东西去 - 快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's eat. - Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.81,0:08:44.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 蛋酒？- 吃披萨啦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Eggnog? - Pizza!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.06,0:08:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是要走了吗？- 吃披萨啦！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you gonna be leaving… - Pizza!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.44,0:08:51.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,自己拿餐巾纸 自己倒饮料啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grab a napkin and pour your own drinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.57,0:08:56.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 圣诞老人也要过海关检查吗？- 我们几点要上床睡觉？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Does Santa go through customs? - What time do we have to go to bed?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.45,0:08:59.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,要早点睡 明早8点出发{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Early. We're leaving at 8 a.m. on the button.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.53,0:09:03.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,喝牛奶啊 走之前我们要喝完所有的牛奶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope you're all drinking milk. I want to get rid of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.50,0:09:08.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 卖披萨的要122块半加小费 - 光是披萨？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Pizza boy needs $122.50, plus tip. - For pizza?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.29,0:09:10.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,十个乘12块{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ten pizzas times 12 bucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.29,0:09:12.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你身上有带钱 - 我带的是旅行支票{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You've got money. - Traveler's checks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.88,0:09:14.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,算了 法兰克 我们有现金{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forget it, Frank. We have cash.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.17,0:09:18.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的那种旅行支票 在法国可能不能用{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You probably got the checks that don't work in France.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.80,0:09:21.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,有起司披萨吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did anyone order me a plain cheese?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.81,0:09:23.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,有 不过你要是要的话…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. But if you want any…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.06,0:09:27.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,等人家吐出来吧 因为已经没有了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…somebody's gonna have to barf it up because it's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.85,0:09:31.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,富勒 慢慢来 别猛灌{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuller! Go easy on the Pepsi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.53,0:09:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文 快拿个盘子来接着！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kev! Kev, get a plate.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.67,0:09:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 护照！- 小心点！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Passports! - Watch it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.38,0:09:58.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,快把护照拿走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. Get these passports out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.39,0:10:06.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧？快过来 你没事吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay, honey? Come here. Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.18,0:10:08.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你发什么神经啊你？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.60,0:10:11.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他先惹我的 他故意吃了我的披萨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He started it! He ate my pizza on purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.56,0:10:13.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,他知道我讨厌香肠和橄榄口味…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He knows I hate sausage and olives…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.69,0:10:16.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,看你干的好事！你这个小浑蛋！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look what you did, you little jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.87,0:10:31.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我上楼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get upstairs now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.25,0:10:32.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.50,0:10:34.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是个衰鬼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're such a disease.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.42,0:10:36.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 闭上你的嘴巴 - 凯文 上楼去！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shut up! - Kevin, upstairs!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.96,0:10:39.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 说晚安 凯文 - 晚安 凯文{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Say good night, Kevin. - "Good night, Kevin."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.09,0:10:43.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么我待遇这么差{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do I get treated like scum?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.18,0:10:46.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 家里乱糟糟的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. This house is just crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.02,0:10:49.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,家里又多了些孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got all these extra kids running around.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.44,0:10:52.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我哥哥也从俄亥俄州过来了 真是乱上加乱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My brother's in from Ohio. It's nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.73,0:10:55.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么不多送些起司披萨来？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How come you didn't bring more cheese pizzas?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.19,0:10:58.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这么多小费 - 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nice tip. Thanks. - Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.65,0:10:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲朋好友都来过节啦？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Having a reunion?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.07,0:11:04.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我先生的哥哥被调到巴黎工作 孩子们还留在这里上学{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My husband's brother transferred to Paris. His kids are still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.66,0:11:07.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想他家人了 所以叫我们全都去巴黎过节{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He missed the family, so he invited us to Paris…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.50,0:11:08.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就可以全在一起了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…so we'll be together.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.91,0:11:12.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们要去巴黎吗？- 是的 明天就动身{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're taking a trip to Paris? - Yes, we leave tomorrow morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.50,0:11:14.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了 真是太好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excellent. Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.04,0:11:18.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是抱歉 这孩子闹别扭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you'll excuse me, this one's a little out of sorts.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.30,0:11:21.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用招呼我 我今天已经跟你丈夫聊过了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry about me. I spoke to your husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.43,0:11:26.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不用担心你家了 有我们呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And don't worry about your home. It's in good hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.14,0:11:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这房子里有15个人 就是你老惹麻烦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fifteen people in this house, and only you have to make trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.31,0:11:33.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是个受气包{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm getting dumped on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.94,0:11:36.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个淘气包 好了 上楼去吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the only one acting up. Now get upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.94,0:11:39.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是已经在楼上了吗 白痴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am upstairs, dummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.94,0:11:41.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,还上三楼呀？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The third floor?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.82,0:11:43.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 上去吧 - 上面太恐怖了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Go. - It's scary up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.20,0:11:46.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,富勒马上就会上去的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuller'll be up in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.28,0:11:49.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不要和他一起睡 他尿床{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to sleep with Fuller. He wets the bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.54,0:11:51.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会把我浇湿 我知道他会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll pee all over me. I know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.00,0:11:53.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我让他睡别的地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll put him somewhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.04,0:11:56.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.71,0:11:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间不早了 快上楼睡吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's too late. Get upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.17,0:12:04.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,家里的每个人都讨厌我！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone in this family hates me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.30,0:12:06.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你应该叫圣诞老人帮你换个新家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then ask Santa for a new family.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.68,0:12:10.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不要什么新家呢！我什么家都不要！家太让人讨厌了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want a new family. I don't want any family. Families suck!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.35,0:12:13.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,就待在上面吧！今天晚上我再也不要看见你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay up there. I don't want to see you again tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.69,0:12:16.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以后一辈子也不想再看见你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to see you for the rest of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.40,0:12:18.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有其他人我也都不想再看到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to see anybody else either.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.11,0:12:21.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好不是认真的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope you don't mean that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.32,0:12:25.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是明天早上醒来家没了 你会伤心的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd feel pretty sad if you woke up and didn't have a family.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.91,0:12:27.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我才不会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I wouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.58,0:12:30.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你再讲一次啊 说不定真会发生呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then say it again. Maybe it'll happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.37,0:12:33.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想永远再也不要看见你们这些讨厌鬼！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope I never see any of you jerks again!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.31,0:12:57.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望他们全都消失{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish they would all just disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.33,0:13:57.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 人在哪？- 谁知道？她说了8点整的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where are they? - I don't know. She said 8 sharp.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.13,0:14:07.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,彼得！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peter!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.68,0:14:11.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 睡过头了！- 睡过头了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We slept in! - We slept in!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.32,0:14:31.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 我是米奇·墨菲 住在对面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, I'm Mitch Murphy. I live across the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.41,0:14:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们要出远门吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys going out of town?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.45,0:14:34.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要去佛罗里达{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going to Florida.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.99,0:14:38.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实我们得先去密苏里接我奶奶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, first we're going to Missouri to pick up my grandma.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.83,0:14:41.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦卡利斯特先生全家是要去法国{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know the McCallisters are going to France?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.54,0:14:42.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里冷吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know if it's cold?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.13,0:14:47.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这些车费油吗？- 小子 不知道 闪开！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do these vans get good mileage? - Kid, I don't know. Hit the road!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.39,0:14:53.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,先点一下人头 然后叫他们全上车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do a head count. Get everyone in the vans.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.85,0:14:55.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,护照和飞机票在哪里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are the passports?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.31,0:14:57.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,在微波炉里烘干{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I put them in the microwave to dry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.43,0:15:01.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这车能跑多快？是自排的吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How fast does this go? Does it have automatic transmission?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.40,0:15:03.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,有四轮驱动吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does it have 4-wheel drive?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.40,0:15:07.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说过了 小子 别烦我 快闪！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I told you before, kid. Don't bother me. Now, beat it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.79,0:15:20.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,在车前面排好队！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Line up in front of the van.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.79,0:15:24.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,排好了 别说话！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Line up and shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.09,0:15:27.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,安静点！我要点人数了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up! I gotta take a head count.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.34,0:15:29.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,一 二 三…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One, two, three…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.59,0:15:31.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,十一 九十二 十二{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eleven, nity-two, twelve…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.68,0:15:34.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴兹 少耍白痴了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buzz, don't be a moron.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.80,0:15:37.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,六 七 八…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Six, seven, eight…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.89,0:15:40.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,九 十 十一{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…nine, 10, 11.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.77,0:15:44.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 一半人上那辆车 另一半上这辆车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, half in this van, half in this one. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.69,0:15:48.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,旅途愉快！从法国带点东西回来给我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have a good trip. Bring me back something French.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.24,0:15:55.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们绝对赶不上飞机了 剩下不到45分钟了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no way we'll make this plane. It leaves in 45 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.24,0:15:56.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,多往好处想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think positive!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.70,0:15:58.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,想有什么用 还是实际点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You be positive. I'll be realistic.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.79,0:16:02.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你家的电线修好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ma'am. Ma'am. Excuse me, your power is fixed…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.58,0:16:06.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你家的电话线绕得乱七八糟的 要好几天才能整理好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but the phones are a mess. It'll take a couple of days to fix.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.38,0:16:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 特别是在过节期间 - 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Especially around the holidays. - Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.00,0:16:10.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,点过人数没有？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you count heads?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.13,0:16:12.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,11个 包括我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eleven, including me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.55,0:16:15.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,5个男孩 6个女孩 家长有4个 2个司机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five boys, six girls, four parents, two drivers,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.73,0:16:17.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有梨树上的一只鹌鹑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a partridge in a pear tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.97,0:16:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞机等一下！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold the plane!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.76,0:16:56.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们错过班机了吗？- 刚好赶上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did we miss it? - You just made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.30,0:17:01.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,经济舱座位随便坐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Single seats only in coach. Take whatever's free.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.60,0:17:04.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要坐窗边！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get a window seat!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.27,0:17:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 孩子们到经济舱 我们坐这 - 4号A座 B座{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Kids are in coach, we're first class. - Seats Four A and B.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.11,0:17:13.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,4号A座 B座 把大衣给我吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four A and B. I'll take your coats.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.99,0:17:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 请系好安全带 - 给我来杯香槟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Fasten your seat belts. - Champagne, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.41,0:17:19.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是免费的吧？- 是的 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's free, isn't it? - Oh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.45,0:17:21.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还好赶上了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.79,0:17:25.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不敢相信 最好没有忘了什么东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you believe it? Hope we didn't forget anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.45,0:18:47.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.09,0:18:54.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.09,0:18:58.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是真的 真水晶做的 - 所以呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's real. That's real crystal. - Yeah, so?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.63,0:19:01.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快放进你的皮包里 - 这样不行 法兰克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Put them in your purse. - Frank, I can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.76,0:19:04.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,快放进你的皮包里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just… Put them in your purse!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.89,0:19:07.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 倒满 倒满{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Fill it up. Fill it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.60,0:19:08.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,请倒满{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fill it up, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.89,0:19:10.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.06,0:19:14.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子们坐经济舱 我们坐头等舱 你不会觉得不好意思吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you feel like a heel, flying first class with the kids in coach?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.90,0:19:16.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子们很好啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. The kids are fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.44,0:19:17.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我小的时候唯一一次的旅行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only time I ever flew as a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.87,0:19:20.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐的还是家庭旅行车 当然不是去法国{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}was in the station wagon, not to France.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.03,0:19:23.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们那时候常去罗拉婶婶和亚瑟叔叔家玩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had to go to Aunt Laura and Uncle Arthur's.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.41,0:19:27.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子们都很好 他们在享受生活 都很愉快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kids are okay. They're having the time of their lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.41,0:19:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.58,0:19:32.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.29,0:19:36.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.47,0:19:43.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈？爸？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom? Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.47,0:19:47.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都去哪里了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.43,0:19:49.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴兹？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buzz?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.44,0:19:53.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴兹？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buzz?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.48,0:19:58.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴兹？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buzz?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.99,0:20:04.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅根？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Megan?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.74,0:20:06.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.95,0:20:08.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.99,0:20:10.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗德？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rod?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.50,0:20:11.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,法兰克叔叔？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uncle Frank?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.12,0:20:14.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,法兰克叔叔 是开玩笑吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uncle Frank, is this a joke?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.34,0:20:19.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅根？琳妮？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Megan? Linnie?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.84,0:20:23.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在玩吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this a joke?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.53,0:20:49.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我乱想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's only my imagination.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.49,0:20:51.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是我乱想的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only my imagination.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.93,0:21:12.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,车子还在这里 他们没有去机场啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The cars are still here. They didn't go to the airport!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.08,0:21:33.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我让全家人消失了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I made my family disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.87,0:21:36.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,「你完全无法照顾自己」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're completely helpless.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.04,0:21:41.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文… 你就是法语中说的那种「无能之辈」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, Kevin, you're what the French call les incompetents.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.09,0:21:45.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,「凯文 我要把你喂给我的大蜘蛛」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin, I'm going to feed you to my tarantula.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.22,0:21:48.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,「凯文 你真是个衰鬼」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin, you are such a disease.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.26,0:21:53.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,「这房子里有15个人 就是你老惹麻烦」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are 15 people, and you're the only one who has to make trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.56,0:21:57.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,「瞧你干的好事 你这个小浑蛋！」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look what you did, you little jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.61,0:22:04.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我让全家人消失了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I made my family disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.25,0:22:20.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我自由了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm free!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.19,0:22:43.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,都不穿衣服 真恶心！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No clothes on anybody. Sickening!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.44,0:22:48.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,酷！鞭炮！留着以后玩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cool! Firecrackers! I'll save these for later.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.40,0:22:51.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴兹 我在翻你的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buzz, I'm going through all your private stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.37,0:22:53.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不快出来收拾我！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You better come out and pound me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.91,0:23:00.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴兹的女朋友 好恶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buzz, your girlfriend! Woof!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.05,0:23:40.17,Note,0,0,0,0,,（邪恶天使）
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.97,0:23:51.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁呀？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.01,0:23:57.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我 小蛇 东西到手了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's me, Snakes. I got the stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.18,0:24:00.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,放在台阶上 然后滚蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave it on the doorstep and get the hell out.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.18,0:24:04.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以 强尼 但钱呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, Johnny, but what about my money?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.48,0:24:05.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,要钱吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What money?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.73,0:24:07.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,老大说有我的一份{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A.C. said you had some dough for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.19,0:24:11.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？该给多少？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that a fact? How much do I owe you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.32,0:24:13.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,老大说过 十分之一{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A.C. said 10 percent.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.41,0:24:16.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,可惜老大说的不算了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too bad A.C. ain't in charge no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.74,0:24:20.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我边吃零食边看烂电影{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, I'm eating junk and watching rubbish!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.25,0:24:22.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不快出来阻止我！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You better come out and stop me!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.00,0:24:25.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,他洗完澡后会打电话给你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll call you when he gets out.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.67,0:24:28.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.30,0:24:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉你要给你什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell you what I'll give you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.92,0:24:34.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我数十下…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna give you to the count of 10…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.93,0:24:37.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个杂种…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to get your ugly, yellow…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.43,0:24:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶快滚蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…no-good keister off my property…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.81,0:24:41.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然就请你吃子弹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…before I pump your guts full of lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.02,0:24:44.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好 对不起 我马上走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, I'm sorry. I'm going.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.90,0:24:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,一 二…十！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One, two…10.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.54,0:25:04.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用找了 畜生！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep the change, you filthy animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.67,0:25:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.30,0:25:20.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.10,0:25:23.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.64,0:25:28.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我有种怪怪的感觉 - 是什么呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I have a terrible feeling. - About what?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.69,0:25:31.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像有什么事我们没做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That we didn't do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.28,0:25:34.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有这感觉是因为我们走得太急了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You feel that way because we left in a hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.95,0:25:38.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们该做的都做了 - 我关咖啡壶了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We took care of everything. - Did I turn off the coffee?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.57,0:25:39.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.95,0:25:41.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我关的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.28,0:25:42.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有没有锁门？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you lock up?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.08,0:25:45.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,锁了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.62,0:25:48.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,车库门关了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you close the garage?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.00,0:25:51.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个我没关{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.29,0:25:53.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把车库门忘了 就这一件事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I forgot to close the garage. That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.47,0:26:01.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不是这件事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, that's not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.39,0:26:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还会忘记什么事呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What else could we be forgetting?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.02,0:26:10.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,是凯文！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.77,0:26:56.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,机长能做的都做了 你家的电话就是不通{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The captain's doing all he can. Your phones are out of order.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.15,0:26:59.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞机一落地我们就打电话 我想不会有什么事的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll call when we land. I'm sure it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.57,0:27:03.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,真可怕 太可怕了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Horrible. Horrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.91,0:27:05.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,太可怕了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just horrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.62,0:27:08.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们怎么会这样呢？怎么会忘记他了呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could we do this? We forgot him.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.37,0:27:10.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没忘记他 就是没点对人数{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We didn't forget him, we just miscounted.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.75,0:27:14.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我算是怎样的母亲啊？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of mother am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.42,0:27:17.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听了也许会好过点 我连我的眼镜都忘记带了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it makes you feel any better, I forgot my reading glasses.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.59,0:27:25.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,光这一条街上 就有五户人家出去度假{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five families gone on one block alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.68,0:27:28.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是他们亲口跟我说的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They all told me from their own mouths.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.89,0:27:30.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是天赐良机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's almost too easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.94,0:27:31.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们看看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check it out:
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.19,0:27:34.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有家里没人的房子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the houses with nobody home…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.44,0:27:37.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,都装了灯光自动计时器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…have automatic timers on their lights.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.65,0:27:40.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我把所有的数字都搞到手了 看这个…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I got it all figured out. Watch this.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.20,0:27:47.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,664号灯马上…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Number 664 will be going on right about…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.45,0:27:49.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,就要亮！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…now.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.71,0:27:52.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 等等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.75,0:27:56.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,672号…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Number 672…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.55,0:28:00.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在亮！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.43,0:28:03.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 等等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.80,0:28:06.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,671号…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}671…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.85,0:28:07.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,亮！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…now.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.43,0:28:13.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这一家 马文 是个金库{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's the one, Marvin. That's the silver tuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.44,0:28:15.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的搞大了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's very G.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.31,0:28:18.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,大吧 啊？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very G, huh? It's loaded.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.94,0:28:21.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,屋里有好多高级货{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's got lots of top-flight goods.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.44,0:28:24.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有音响 录影机 - 玩具{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stereos, VCRs… - Toys?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.95,0:28:27.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能有些精品珠宝首饰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably looking at some very fine jewelry.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.95,0:28:29.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许还有现钞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Possible cash horde.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.08,0:28:32.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,有价证券什么的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Odd marketable securities.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.12,0:28:35.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁知道呢 反正是个金库{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who knows? It's a gem.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.33,0:28:38.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿好你的铁橇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grab your crowbar.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.30,0:28:40.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,铁橇真好用{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowbars up.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.15,0:29:41.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,走哪边？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which way?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.86,0:29:44.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们绕到后面到地下室去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll go around back, down the basement.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.05,0:30:07.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你不是说他们都走了吗？- 他们是今天早上走的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You said they were gone. - They were gonna leave today.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.05,0:30:09.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,快离开这吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.13,0:30:48.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得用一下电话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to use the phone, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.30,0:30:52.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,事情很急 我们真的非常需要打这个电话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an emergency. We really have to make a call.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.22,0:30:54.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托你！我们的弟弟单独一个人在家里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please! Our brother's home alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.43,0:30:57.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,把电话给我！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give us the phone!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.52,0:30:58.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起！谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.94,0:31:01.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打电话给警察 你去订一下回家的飞机票{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm calling the police. Book us a flight home.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.86,0:31:04.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿些零钱 打电话给你认识的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get change out of here. Call everybody you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.94,0:31:09.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的通讯录 打电话给住在我们街上的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's my address book. You and Frank call everyone on our street.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.32,0:31:11.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能有人能帮我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe somebody can help us.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.32,0:31:14.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂？她等一下回你电话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello? Hello? Oh, she'll have to call you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.12,0:31:25.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,真可笑 只有胆小鬼才躲在床底下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is ridiculous. Only a wimp would be hiding under a bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.17,0:31:29.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不是胆小鬼 我现在是一家之主了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I can't be a wimp. I'm the man of the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.47,0:31:39.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会再害怕了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I'm not afraid anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.85,0:31:44.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说了 我不会害怕了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said, I'm not afraid anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.98,0:31:48.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,都听见了吗？我再也不害怕了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you hear me? I'm not afraid anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.39,0:32:20.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,警察局{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Village police department.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.85,0:32:24.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在在巴黎 我儿子现在独自在家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm calling from Paris. I have a son who's home alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.48,0:32:29.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我想请你们派个人 去我家看看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like somebody to go there. Tell him that we're coming home to get him.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.82,0:32:31.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我帮你转到家庭危机解救中心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, let me connect you with Family Crisis Intervention.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.03,0:32:33.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 这不是家庭纠纷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No it's not a family crisis.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.53,0:32:34.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,别挂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.82,0:32:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉瑞 接一下电话 有位神经质女士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Larry, can you pick up? There's some hyper lady on hold.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.45,0:32:42.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 几号线？罗丝 - 2号{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What line, Rose? - Two.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.46,0:32:45.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,家庭危机解救中心 我是鲍沙警官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Family Crisis Intervention, Sergeant Balzak.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.08,0:32:48.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在在巴黎 我儿子独自在家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm calling from Paris. I have a son who's home alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.13,0:32:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这孩子家里有没有酒鬼 对他使用过暴力？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has the child been involved in violence with a drunk family member?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.01,0:32:55.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.34,0:32:57.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在家发生过意外吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has he been involved in a household accident?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.05,0:33:00.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 希望他没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. I hope not.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.60,0:33:05.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这孩子吃了有毒的东西 还是有什么硬东西卡在喉咙里了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has the child ingested any poison or is an object lodged in his throat?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.85,0:33:09.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是他单独一人在家里！我想请个人到我家里…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, he's home alone! I'd like somebody to go over to the house…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.52,0:33:11.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,看一下他有没有事！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and see if he's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.44,0:33:16.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想让我们到你家去 就是看一下你的孩子？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want us to go to your house, just to check on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.24,0:33:17.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.99,0:33:19.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我帮你转接到警察局{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me connect you to the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.78,0:33:21.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚刚就是他们把我转接到你这里的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They just transferred me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.41,0:33:23.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 罗丝？神经质在2线 - 等等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Rose! Hyper on 2. - Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.79,0:33:27.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等一下 - 请等一下 别挂电话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hold on, please. - No, please don't hang up. Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.25,0:33:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁打通了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any luck?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.67,0:33:31.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.25,0:33:33.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们一个人也没找到 - 莱丝莉？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I couldn't get anybody. - Leslie?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.13,0:33:36.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是电话录音{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing but a bunch of answering machines.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.59,0:33:41.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁来接电话吧！快接电话！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody pick up. Pick up!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.76,0:33:43.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 女士 又是你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, hi, ma'am. It's you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.93,0:33:47.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在在巴黎 我儿子现在独自在家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm calling from Paris. I have a son who's home alone, and I…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.10,0:33:51.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们派一个警官到你家去看一下你儿子吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll send a policeman over to your house to check on your son.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.18,0:34:24.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,家里没有人 房子看起来很安全{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no one home. The house looks secure.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.06,0:34:27.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他们再数数孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell them to count their kids again.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.23,0:34:30.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能换掉一个乘客或者…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't bump somebody or ask or…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.86,0:34:32.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的不能那么做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no way I can do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.90,0:34:34.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能不能问问看？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't there a way if you ask somebody?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.19,0:34:36.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一件紧急事件…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you said it's an emergency…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.90,0:34:38.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是我不能要求别人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cannot ask them.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.45,0:34:40.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要派警官到家里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A policeman's going over to the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.91,0:34:43.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 可是机位全都满了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's a relief. Everything here is booked.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.99,0:34:45.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有去芝加哥的航班了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing to Chicago?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.33,0:34:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,芝加哥 纽约 那什维尔都满了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing to Chicago, New York, Nashville.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.87,0:34:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 私人飞机呢？- 对不起 我们没有这个业务{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What about a private plane? - Sorry. We don't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.25,0:34:56.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们现在能做的就是 为我们订星期五早上的机位{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only thing is a booking for us on Friday morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.34,0:34:58.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,星期五？还有两天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Friday morn… That's two days away.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.05,0:35:01.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子们都累了 你也累坏了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The kids are exhausted and so are you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.35,0:35:02.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们待在机场实在没有什么事能做了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing we can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.80,0:35:07.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们先去罗伯家 在那里我们再给警察局打电话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I say we go over to Rob's, and that way we can call the police again.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.27,0:35:11.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会离开机场的 除非坐上飞机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not leaving here unless it's on an airplane.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.69,0:35:13.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,夫人 我们就是要尽一切可能帮助乘客{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madame, we are doing everything we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.02,0:35:17.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你留在机场候补 或许能碰上空位{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you want to stay at the airport, maybe we can get you on standby.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.24,0:35:21.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,是有这种可能的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is a possibility that a seat will open up.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.86,0:35:24.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这下行了吧 - 好吧 我等着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is that okay? - Yes. I'll wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.41,0:35:32.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我会想你的 - 再见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bye. I'll miss you, honey. - Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.63,0:35:38.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,别把你自己搞丢了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you get lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.97,0:35:41.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜拜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.90,0:35:59.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,洗澡 擦香皂 全身上下都洗洗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I took a shower, washing every body part with actual soap.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.28,0:36:02.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,手指缝…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Including all my major crevices…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.32,0:36:04.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,脚指缝 还有肚脐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…between my toes and in my belly button…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.99,0:36:07.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然从来没洗过 不过感觉还不错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…which I never did before but enjoyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.91,0:36:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,像大人那样用洗发精还有润发乳洗头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I washed my hair with adult formula shampoo and used cream rinse.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.00,0:36:17.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像没有牙刷了 一会儿出去买一枝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't find my toothbrush, so I'll pick one up today.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.50,0:36:19.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么事了 还满像样子的嘛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Other than that, I'm in good shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.22,0:37:13.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,好耶！巴兹存的零用钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right! Buzz's life savings.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.29,0:37:42.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还以为墨菲全家都去佛罗里达了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought the Murphys went to Florida.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.19,0:38:02.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可真是天下名偷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're one of the great cat burglars of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.44,0:38:05.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能不能小声一点？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think you can keep it down a little in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.78,0:38:09.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,家中无人 有事请留话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've reached the Murphys. Please leave a message after the beep.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.41,0:38:14.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是彼得·麦卡利斯特 现在在我哥巴黎的公寓里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Peter McCallister again. We're in Paris at my brother's.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.54,0:38:17.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在把这里的电话号码留给你 国码是33{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me give you the number here. The country code is 33.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.17,0:38:23.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,区码是14 电话号码是694876{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The area code is 14 and the number is 694-876…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.55,0:38:25.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 哈利！- 干嘛？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, Harry. - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.59,0:38:28.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨晚我们去的那家 是彼得的家吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That house we ran last night, was that the McCallister's?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.59,0:38:30.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.43,0:38:33.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 打电话到巴黎给我 - 你说的对 他们早走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Call me in Paris. - You're right. They're gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.18,0:38:40.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我就知道他们不在 - 今晚搞定那个金库{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I knew they were. - Silver tuna tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.86,0:38:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,能帮你什么吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How may I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.87,0:38:55.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种牙刷是不是美国牙医协会认可的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this toothbrush approved by the American Dental Association?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.95,0:38:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.58,0:39:02.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 上面没有说明 - 请你查一下好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It doesn't say, hon. - Can you please find out?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.17,0:39:06.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 贺伯！- 什么事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Herb. - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.09,0:39:10.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这里有人对牙刷有疑问{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a question here about a toothbrush.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.93,0:39:21.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知不知道这种牙刷有没有经过牙医协会认可？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know, is this brush approved by the American Dental Association?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.60,0:39:22.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.25,0:39:47.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,到这来付钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, hon, you pay for that here.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.76,0:39:51.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 你得付钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, you have to pay for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.39,0:39:55.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子 孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son! Son! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.93,0:39:58.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉米 快抓住那孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jimmy, stop that boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.81,0:40:03.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.19,0:40:06.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.32,0:40:09.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓小偷！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoplifter!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.66,0:40:14.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,哎 小子！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Hey, kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.87,0:40:23.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我过来！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.75,0:40:26.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我站住！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop it, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.96,0:40:28.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.25,0:41:08.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是罪犯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a criminal.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.45,0:41:37.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么好笑的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's so funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.95,0:41:39.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,笑什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's so funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.74,0:41:40.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你笑什么啊？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you laughing?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.16,0:41:45.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,又犯老毛病了吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.79,0:41:48.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,又没关水了对吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You left the water running.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.17,0:41:51.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这是什么毛病？我早跟你说过不要这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you do that? I told you not to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.80,0:41:54.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这叫雁过留声人过留名 - 雁过留声人过留名{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's our calling card. - Calling card.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.38,0:41:56.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,天下所有的大盗都要留下他们的标记{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the great ones leave their mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.76,0:41:58.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就是「水盗」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're the Wet Bandits.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.76,0:42:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有病你知不知道？真的有病{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're sick, you know? You're really sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.18,0:42:03.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我没病 - 你有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm not sick. - Yes, you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.18,0:42:05.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么搞就是有病{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a sick thing to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.19,0:42:14.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不许再这么搞了！- 不要教我怎么搞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We don't need that. - Don't tell me…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.28,0:42:16.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱怎么搞就怎么搞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can do it if I want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.28,0:42:20.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有病！小心点！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not sick. Hey, watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.79,0:42:30.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！嘿！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.33,0:42:32.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,走路得小心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta watch out for traffic.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.67,0:42:34.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对不起 - 气死人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sorry. - Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.80,0:42:37.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣诞老人可不去殡仪馆送礼物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Santy don't visit the funeral homes, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.22,0:42:39.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.30,0:42:42.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣诞快乐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Merry Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.57,0:42:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.32,0:42:56.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不喜欢他的眼神{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't like the way that kid looked at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.65,0:43:00.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 以前你见过他吗？- 我这个星期见了几百个小孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ever seen him before? - I saw a hundred kids this week.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.32,0:43:03.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们看看他去哪家？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's see what house he goes into.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.69,0:43:37.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他干嘛走那么快？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why's he going faster?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.28,0:43:39.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你说过不对劲的嘛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you something's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.57,0:43:41.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的眼神很怪 他跑什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He looked at me weird. Why would he run?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.73,0:44:19.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许他进教堂了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe he went in the church.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.78,0:44:22.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我可不到里面去 - 我也不去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm not going in there. - Me neither.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.78,0:44:24.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,离开这吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.51,0:44:46.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要做好准备 等这些家伙过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When those guys come back, I'll be ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.95,0:45:12.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们回来了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did they come back?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.66,0:45:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,从巴黎？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}From Paris?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.12,0:45:52.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们明天再来 说不定他们就走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll come back tomorrow. Maybe they'll be gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.25,0:45:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们赶快走吧 别被人看见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We better go before somebody sees us.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.53,0:46:29.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,看我在厨房找到了什么东西？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look what I found in the kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.62,0:46:31.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,法兰克 那个晚点才能吃{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frank, those are for later.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.54,0:46:38.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子们 吃小虾子吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you want a little shrimp, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.08,0:46:41.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会说英语吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you speak English?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.34,0:46:46.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,有没有…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, is there…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.47,0:46:55.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 找到人了？- 我正在找儿子！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did you get anybody? - I am looking for my son!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.89,0:46:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个人都找不到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I can't find anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.81,0:47:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,全都出去逛街了 一过节不会有人在家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're all shopping. Nobody's home for the holidays.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.15,0:47:02.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,别在意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never mind, forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.69,0:47:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这节过得真无聊 - 怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is so pointless. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.78,0:47:08.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在这公寓里憋到烂掉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're here rotting in this apartment.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.07,0:47:11.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文在家 妈在机场{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin's at home. Mom's at the airport.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.66,0:47:14.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那又怎样？- 你就不担心凯文出事吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So? - You're not worried about Kevin?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.45,0:47:19.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我干嘛担心他？他这个讨厌鬼 自己自作自受{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why should I be? He acted like a jerk, and now he caught it in the butt.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.58,0:47:24.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是他还小啊 又没人帮他！你就不想想他可能会吓坏的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's so little and helpless. Don't you think he's flipped out?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.17,0:47:27.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他应该在真实世界里过几天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The trout can use a couple of days in the real world.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.46,0:47:29.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就一点儿都不担心 他可能会发生什么事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not worried something might happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.59,0:47:32.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,不担心 三个理由{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. For three reasons:
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.68,0:47:35.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一 我就没这么幸运{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A, I'm not that lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.43,0:47:37.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,第二 我们家里装了烟雾警报器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two, we have smoke detectors…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.60,0:47:41.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后 我们住在全美国最无聊的街上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and D, we live in the most boring street in the United States…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.65,0:47:46.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是最不会发生危险的地方 就这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…where nothing even remotely dangerous will ever happen. Period.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.84,0:48:02.27,Note,0,0,0,0,,（请走后门）
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.14,0:48:14.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁呀？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.34,0:48:16.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,小尼罗披萨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Little Nero's. I have your pizza.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.18,0:48:19.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,放在台阶上 然后滚蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave it on the doorstep and get the hell out.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.81,0:48:22.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.65,0:48:25.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我的钱呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about the money?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.40,0:48:27.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,要钱吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What money?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.69,0:48:31.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃披萨是要付钱的 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you have to pay for your pizza, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.32,0:48:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？该给多少？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that a fact? How much do I owe you?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.20,0:48:39.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,11块8毛 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That'll be $11.80, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.50,0:48:49.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用找了 畜生！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep the change, you filthy animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.01,0:48:52.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 小气鬼 - 嘿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Cheapskate. - Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.97,0:48:55.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我数十下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna give you to the count of 10…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.47,0:48:57.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个杂种…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to get your ugly, yellow…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.10,0:49:00.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶快滚蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…no-good keister off my property…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.39,0:49:02.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然就请你吃子弹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…before I pump your guts full of lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.73,0:49:05.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,一 二… 十！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One, two…ten.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.47,0:49:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次就我一个人独享起司披萨了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lovely cheese pizza, just for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.01,0:49:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞往达拉斯的班机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}… to Dallas/Fort Worth.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.85,0:49:43.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,就要起飞了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}American Airlines…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.39,0:49:47.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还有500美元 一个快译通{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we have the $500, the pocket translator…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.15,0:49:50.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有两张头等舱的机票{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the two first-class seats, that's an upgrade…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.73,0:49:51.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的表是真的劳力士吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that a real Rolex?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.61,0:49:55.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你看呢？- 假的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you think it is? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.11,0:49:59.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁能看得出来？我这还有个戒指{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But who can tell? I also have a ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.57,0:50:01.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,真漂亮！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.62,0:50:02.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始登机了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're boarding.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.58,0:50:06.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,她愿意出星期五的两张头等舱机票跟我们换{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's offered us two first-class tickets if we go Friday.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.00,0:50:08.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,外加一个戒指 一只表{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plus a ring, a watch,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.69,0:50:11.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个快译通 还有500美元 还有…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}a pocket translator, $500 and…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.46,0:50:12.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,耳环{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The earrings.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.05,0:50:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,她有一大盒子的耳环呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's got her own earrings. A whole shoebox full of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.01,0:50:18.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快点 - 那…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on, come on. - No, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.01,0:50:21.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很急{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm desperate.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.18,0:50:25.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我求求你们 你也是母亲吧 求你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm begging you. From a mother to a mother. Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.06,0:50:30.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 噢 艾德 - 求求你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, Ed. - Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.77,0:50:33.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.20,0:50:41.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的圣诞老人 去年我的礼物是个妹妹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Dear Santa, I got a sister last year.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.45,0:50:44.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,今年我想要粘土{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This year I'd rather have Clay-Doh."
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.38,0:50:59.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是有意的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't mean it.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.63,0:51:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,都回来吧 我不再惹你们了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you come back, I'll never be a pain in the butt again.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.14,0:51:06.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我保证 晚安{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promise. Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.49,0:52:49.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,微波炉快餐好吃吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are those microwave dinners good?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.04,0:52:52.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不知道 - 那我试一次好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't know. - I'll give them a whirl.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.30,0:52:59.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,给孩子的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.22,0:53:04.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 我有折价券{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on, I got a coupon for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.68,0:53:07.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,是早上从报纸上剪下来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was in the paper this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.18,0:53:12.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,19块8毛3分{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}$19.83.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.85,0:53:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.19,0:53:19.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己一个人来的吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you here by yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.03,0:53:22.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士我才8岁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ma'am, I'm 8 years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.94,0:53:27.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说我会一个人来吗？当然不会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I'd be here alone? I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.87,0:53:28.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妈妈在哪？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's your mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.16,0:53:30.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 在车上 - 那你爸爸呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- In the car. - Where's your dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.95,0:53:33.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 上班 - 你的兄弟姐妹呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's at work. - What about brothers and sisters?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.08,0:53:35.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是独生子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm an only child.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.96,0:53:38.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你住哪里？- 我不能告诉你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where do you live? - I can't tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.25,0:53:41.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 干嘛不告诉我？- 因为我不认识你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why not? - Because you're a stranger.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.67,0:54:23.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈啰 凯文{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Kevin!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.51,0:54:27.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.31,0:54:42.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,真搞不懂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.19,0:54:45.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家现在看上去好像又没人在里面了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It looks like there's nobody's home.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.36,0:54:48.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨晚上满屋子都是人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last night the place is jumping.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.20,0:54:51.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不对劲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something ain't right.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.83,0:54:52.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,去看看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.88,0:55:03.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.46,0:55:06.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是现在还是明天呀？猪脑啊你！去啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, tomorrow, egghead! Now! Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.26,0:55:10.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,就现在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Now? "
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.78,0:55:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.20,0:55:33.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你快滚蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the hell out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.99,0:55:37.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以 强尼 钱呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, Johnny. But what about my money?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.25,0:55:38.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,要钱吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What money?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.58,0:55:40.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,老大说有我的一份{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A.C. said you had some dough for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.00,0:55:43.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？该给多少？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that a fact? How much do I owe you?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.09,0:55:45.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,老大说过 十分之一{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A.C. said 10 percent.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.13,0:55:49.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,可惜老大说的不算了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too bad A.C. ain't in charge no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.84,0:55:51.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.22,0:55:53.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在楼上洗澡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's upstairs, taking a bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.64,0:55:56.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,他洗完澡后会打电话给你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll call you when he gets out.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.27,0:56:02.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 告诉你要给你什么 小蛇…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I tell you what I'm gonna give you, Snakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.19,0:56:06.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 小蛇？- 我数十下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Snakes? - I'll give you to the count of 10…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.48,0:56:08.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个杂种…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to get your ugly, yellow, no-good…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.90,0:56:10.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶快滚蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…keister off my property…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.11,0:56:13.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然就请你吃子弹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…before I pump your guts full of lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.37,0:56:15.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好 强尼 对不起 我马上走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, Johnny. I'm sorry. I'm going.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.20,0:56:19.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,一 二…十！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One, two…ten.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.35,0:56:41.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用找了 畜生！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep the change, you filthy animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.15,0:56:47.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,出什么事了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.36,0:56:49.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面不知道是什么人让人打死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know who, but somebody got blown away.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.15,0:56:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人抢了我们的生意 他们就在里面！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody beat us, they're in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.65,0:56:53.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,是两个人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.99,0:56:56.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们正在吵架 一个人拿枪把另一个给干掉了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was arguing. One blew the other one away.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.78,0:56:58.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谁？- 不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.20,0:57:02.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认出他们当中一个人的声音{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I recognized one of their voices.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.02,0:57:04.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我以前听到过小蛇这个名字{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard that name "Snakes" before.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.54,0:57:08.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,小蛇？小蛇 我不认识叫小蛇的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Snakes? Snakes. Snakes. I don't know no Snakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.42,0:57:11.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,小蛇 我们还是快走吧！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Snakes. Let's get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.05,0:57:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,别慌 别慌{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold it. Hold it.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.51,0:57:18.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们等在这里看看到底是谁干的 这块地盘也是我们的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's wait and see who it is. We work this neighborhood too.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.76,0:57:21.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,说不定警察会问我们…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suppose the cops finger us for a job…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.89,0:57:24.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后他们问这附近的谋杀案的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and they ask us about a murder in the area.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.06,0:57:28.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是能指认出个人不是很好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Won't it be nice to have a face to go with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.73,0:57:31.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可是个好主意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.40,0:57:35.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然是 小蛇？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course it's a good idea. Snakes?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.70,0:57:37.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的名字听起来像是小蛇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He sounded like a snake.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.46,0:57:45.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,班机全部客满{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything's full.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.83,0:57:47.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,班机全部客满？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything's full?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.54,0:57:50.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,没办法 圣诞前夕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm very sorry, but it is Christmas Eve.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.13,0:57:52.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他航空公司呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about another airline?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.59,0:58:00.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,都满了 我可以帮您在饭店订个房间吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing available. May I help you get a hotel room?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.60,0:58:02.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,您可以搭明天下午的航班去芝加哥{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tomorrow we can get you a flight.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.83,0:58:04.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我等不了那么长时间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't wait that long.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.77,0:58:08.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 女士 我们已经尽力了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, ma'am, but we're doing absolutely everything we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.90,0:58:15.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我挡到你了 对不起 你有地方度假{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in your way. I'm sorry. You've places to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.07,0:58:18.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有机票 很好 对不起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got a ticket there, good. Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.74,0:58:22.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我差不多有60个小时没睡觉了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I have been awake for almost 60 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.51,0:58:24.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,累得要死 身上又脏兮兮的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm tired and I'm dirty.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.17,0:58:26.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从芝加哥到了巴黎 去了达拉斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have been from Chicago to Paris, to Dallas to…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.93,0:58:28.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么鬼地方？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.67,0:58:30.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯克蓝顿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scranton.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.38,0:58:32.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我急着回家去看我8岁的儿子！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying to get home to my 8-year-old son.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.88,0:58:36.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你却告诉我没有办法？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you're telling me it's hopeless?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.42,0:58:38.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对不起 - 不 不用{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm sorry. - No. No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.18,0:58:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是圣诞节 是充满希望的时候{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Christmas! The season of perpetual hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.63,0:58:46.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,到跑道上去拦飞机也无所谓…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I have to get on your runway and hitchhike…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.27,0:58:48.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管花多大代价…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…if it costs me everything I own…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.48,0:58:51.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果需要把灵魂卖给魔鬼…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…if I have to sell my soul to the devil himself…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.52,0:58:54.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了能回家去看我的儿子 我也卖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I am going to get home to my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.61,0:58:57.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我今天能帮你任何忙…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ma'am, if there was anything…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.86,0:58:59.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就做吧！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it. Do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.66,0:59:01.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我能帮你订一间的房 - 干嘛？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can get you a hotel room. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.87,0:59:05.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思 打搅一下行吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you excuse us for a sec? Can I see you for a second, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.08,0:59:07.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse us.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.04,0:59:12.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无意中听到你说的话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got a little bit of a dilemma.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.67,0:59:15.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也遇到了危机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got a crisis ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.67,0:59:17.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,允许我自我介绍一下 我叫卡斯·波林斯基{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Allow me to introduce myself. Gus Polinski.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.34,0:59:22.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,中西部波卡音乐之王{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Polka King of the Midwest?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.81,0:59:27.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,听说过肯诺夏舞者吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Kenosha Kickers?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.60,0:59:29.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗨 - 你好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hi there. - Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.81,0:59:34.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系 我以为你能认出我们来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's okay. I thought you might have recognized…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.44,0:59:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,几年前我出了几首曲子 轰动一时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had a few hits a few years ago. That's why I just…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.07,0:59:39.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,「波卡 波卡 波卡」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Polka, Polka, Polka"?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.86,0:59:44.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,没听过吗？那么「双湖波卡」呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No? "Twin Lakes Polka"?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.33,0:59:45.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有「亚犸乎兹亚波卡」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Yamahoozie Polka, "
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.91,0:59:49.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是「亲亲我波卡」？还有「旋转波卡」…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}a.k.a."Kiss Me Polka"? "Polka Twist"?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.49,0:59:50.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些都是歌曲吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are songs?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.04,0:59:53.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我们这帮人相当受欢迎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Yeah, we… Some fairly big hits for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.17,0:59:55.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,特别是在70年代早期{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, in the early '70s.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.17,0:59:58.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们卖了623张唱片{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we sold about 623 copies of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.17,1:00:00.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 在芝加哥吗？- 不 在希波干市{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- In Chicago? - No, Sheboygan.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.97,1:00:02.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,全市都轰动了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very big in Sheboygan.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.84,1:00:04.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说能帮我吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you say you could help?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.51,1:00:08.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在喃喃自语 我们的航班取消了…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, I'm rambling on here. Our flight was canceled…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.47,1:00:12.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们准备开车去 看到那个穿黄夹克上有标记的人吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…so we gotta drive. See the guy in the yellow jacket over there?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.06,1:00:16.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他租给我们一辆漂亮的大车 我们开着去密尔瓦基{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gonna rent us a nice big van to drive to Milwaukee.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.69,1:00:20.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚才听你说要去芝加哥？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I heard you had some problems getting to Chicago?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.40,1:00:21.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,去看你的孩子还是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To see your kid?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.90,1:00:25.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走的时候把他忘在家里了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My son. He… We left, and he's there.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.03,1:00:29.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要是去芝加哥 我们很高兴可以开车送你去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you have to get to Chicago, we'll gladly drive you.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.87,1:00:31.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,正好是去密瓦基的路上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's on the way to Milwaukee.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.46,1:00:34.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们可以送我？- 当然要送{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You'd give me a ride? - Sure, why not?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.08,1:00:36.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还是早点回家看孩子吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta get home.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.79,1:00:39.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 坐车去芝加哥？- 现在是圣诞节嘛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A ride to Chicago? - Sure, it's Christmastime.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.42,1:00:42.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你！噢 谢谢！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you. Oh, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.26,1:00:44.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不介意和波卡流浪艺人一起坐车吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't mind going with polka bums?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.59,1:00:46.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不介意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'd love to.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.91,1:01:11.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 马文{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Marv. Marv, Marv!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.62,1:01:13.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.42,1:01:23.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看我们是让这个小子骗了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we're getting scammed by a kindergartner.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.37,1:01:55.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 过来帮帮忙好不好？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad, can you come here and help me?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.38,1:02:02.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,还记得那天我们见到的那个小孩吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember that kid we saw the other day?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.72,1:02:05.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,就住这{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He lives here.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.55,1:02:08.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,那要是孩子在家 父母肯定也在家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If the kid's here, the parents got to be.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.64,1:02:10.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,他可是单独一人在家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's home alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.27,1:02:20.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你白痴啊！你要晚上才来吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? You want to come back tonight?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.61,1:02:21.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个孩子在这你也敢来？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even with the kid here?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.23,1:02:24.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得不能这样搞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think that's a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.57,1:02:27.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这房子使我们决定要在这个街区动手的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That house is the reason we worked this block.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.53,1:02:29.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,自从我第一次看到这栋房子 我就想要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ever since I saw that house, I wanted it.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.20,1:02:32.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一步步来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's take it one step at a time.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.37,1:02:36.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,先把卡车给腾空了 再吃点饭 九点左右我们再回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll unload the van, get a bite to eat, we'll come back about 9:00.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.21,1:02:38.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,九点左右{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nine o'clock.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.62,1:02:39.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,那时候天就黑了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way it's dark.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.50,1:02:43.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,对啊 小孩子怕黑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, kids are scared of the dark.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.42,1:02:46.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也怕黑 你自己知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're afraid of the dark too. You know you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.59,1:02:48.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不怕黑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.14,1:02:51.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你就是怕！- 不怕不怕不怕！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, you are. - Not, not, not.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.22,1:02:52.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是怕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are so.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.60,1:02:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈 你在哪呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.32,1:03:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会吹这个吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you play?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.24,1:03:14.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不要试试看？来嘛 试试 试试{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you want to try? Go ahead, try it. Try it!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.90,1:03:29.16,Note,0,0,0,0,,（圣诞老人）
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.31,1:03:44.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对不起 - 什么事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Excuse me. - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.07,1:03:47.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 这双鞋真漂亮！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, nice shoes.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.11,1:03:49.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.82,1:03:53.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣诞老人还在这吗？我有重要的事要跟他说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he still here? It's really important that I see him.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.08,1:03:57.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他正要上车呢 你要是跑快点还能赶上他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's getting in his car. If you hurry, you can catch him.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.83,1:04:03.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,真该死！居然在圣诞前夕 给圣诞老人开罚单{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How low! Giving Kriss Kringle a parking ticket on Christmas Eve!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.38,1:04:05.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,那下次是什么？难道还要给复活节兔子打狂犬病疫苗吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's next, rabies shots for the Easter Bunny?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.17,1:04:07.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣诞老人 等一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Santa, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.01,1:04:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 能耽误你一下吗？- 要快一点 圣诞老人快迟到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can I talk to you? - Make it quick. Santa's running late.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.14,1:04:16.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你不是真的圣诞老人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you're not the real Santa Claus.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.93,1:04:20.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么会这样说？我想知道为什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What makes you say that? Just out of curiosity.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.60,1:04:24.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我能明白是怎么回事了 - 是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm old enough to know how it works. - All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.27,1:04:26.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我也知道你在为圣诞老人做事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I also know you work for him.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.65,1:04:29.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我想请你帮我传话给他 - 说吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'd like you to give him a message. - Shoot.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.94,1:04:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是凯文·麦卡利斯特 住林肯大道671号 要电话号码吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin McCallister, 671 Lincoln Blvd. Do you need the phone number?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.03,1:04:36.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, that's all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.66,1:04:38.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,这件事非常重要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is extremely important.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.66,1:04:41.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,请你告诉圣诞老人 今年不要送礼物了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please tell him instead of presents,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.97,1:04:43.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,就把我的全家人送回来就行了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want my family back.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.21,1:04:46.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要玩具 什么都不要 就要彼得 凯蒂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No toys. Nothing but Peter, Kate,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.75,1:04:48.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴兹 梅根 琳妮 杰夫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buzz, Megan, Linnie and Jeff.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.84,1:04:50.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有我的婶婶和表兄弟姐妹们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And my aunt and my cousins.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.13,1:04:54.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有时间的话 还有我的叔叔法兰克 好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if he has time, my Uncle Frank. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.93,1:04:57.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.01,1:05:00.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我会想办法的 - 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll see what I can do. - Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.52,1:05:05.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等！我的小矮人把剩下的棒棒糖给她的男朋友了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. My elf took the last of the candy canes home to her boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.35,1:05:07.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没关系 - 不用 别傻了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's okay. - No, don't be silly.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.36,1:05:10.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,见到圣诞老人的人 一定要得到点东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody who sees Santa has gotta get something.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.44,1:05:14.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这儿 伸出你的小爪子 拿去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, hold out your little paw there. There you go.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.07,1:05:17.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别吃多了 不然吃不下饭 - 不会的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't spoil your dinner. - I won't.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.83,1:05:19.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.46,1:05:32.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.43,1:08:30.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣诞快乐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Merry Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.35,1:08:34.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以坐下吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I sit down?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.95,1:08:47.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的孙女在那上面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my granddaughter.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.95,1:08:49.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个红头发的小女孩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The little red-haired girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.87,1:08:54.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,她和你差不多大 你认识她吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's about your age. You know her?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.79,1:08:55.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,不认识{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.13,1:08:59.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你住我隔壁 是吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You live next to me, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.38,1:09:02.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你见到我可以跟我打招呼 你不用害怕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can say hello when you see me. You don't have to be afraid.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.93,1:09:08.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,城里有很多关于我的传言 但都不是真的 懂吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a lot of things going around about me, but none of it's true. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.72,1:09:11.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你今年有当个乖孩子吗？- 我想有吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You've been good this year? - I think so.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.39,1:09:13.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,敢发誓吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You swear to it?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.10,1:09:15.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.40,1:09:19.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有你觉得自己不好 才会到这个地方来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Well, this is the place to be if you're feeling bad about yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.40,1:09:23.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是吗？- 我是这么想的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It is? - I think so.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.24,1:09:25.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你觉得自己不好吗？- 没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you feeling bad about yourself? - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.29,1:09:35.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,最近我一直惹人厌 尽说些不该说的话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been kind of a pain lately. I said some things I shouldn't have.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.62,1:09:38.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,今年我的表现真的不太好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really haven't been too good this year.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.84,1:09:39.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.05,1:09:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我满难过的 我真的很爱我的家人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm kind of upset because I really like my family.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.51,1:09:48.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽管有时我嘴上说我不爱他们 我甚至心里想过我不爱他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even though sometimes I say I don't. Sometimes I even think I don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.72,1:09:51.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你明白了吗？- 差不多吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you get that? - I think so.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.93,1:09:54.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,家家都有一本难念的经{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you feel about your family is a complicated thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.02,1:09:57.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,特别是和哥哥的关系{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Especially with an older brother.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.19,1:10:00.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,内心深处虽然总是爱着他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deep down, you'll always love them.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.73,1:10:05.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,但却不知怎样去表现 于是就伤害了他们也伤害了自己{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you can forget that you love them. You can hurt them, they can hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.24,1:10:07.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这跟年纪大小好像没有关系{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's not just because you're young.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.37,1:10:12.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是不是想知道我到这里的真正原因？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to know the real reason why I'm here?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.29,1:10:13.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.00,1:10:18.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是来听我孙女唱歌的 而今晚我是不能来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I came to hear my granddaughter sing. I can't come hear her tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.38,1:10:19.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有约会吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have plans?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.88,1:10:21.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.88,1:10:23.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不欢迎我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not welcome.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.01,1:10:25.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,教堂不欢迎你？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}At church?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.47,1:10:27.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,教堂总是欢迎你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're always welcome at church.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.76,1:10:29.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我的儿子不欢迎我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not welcome with my son.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.31,1:10:35.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,几年前 你们家搬来这个区前…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Years back, before you and your family moved on the block…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.81,1:10:37.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和我儿子大吵了一架{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I had an argument with my son.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.27,1:10:39.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他多大了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How old is he?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.65,1:10:41.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是大人了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's grown up.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.57,1:10:47.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都发了火 我说我不想再看见他了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We lost our tempers, and I said I didn't care to see him anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.74,1:10:52.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也是这么说的 从那时起 我们就没讲过话了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said the same, and we haven't spoken to each other since.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.24,1:10:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然你想他 干嘛不打电话给他？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you miss him, why don't you call him?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.12,1:10:58.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我害怕我要是打电话给他 他不会理我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid if I call, he won't talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.50,1:11:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.00,1:11:04.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不知道 就是害怕他不理我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. I'm just afraid he won't.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.51,1:11:07.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是我存心冒犯你 你岁数大了 是不是不该害怕了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No offense, but aren't you a little old to be afraid?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.88,1:11:11.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,人一天天变老…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can be old for a lot of things.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.26,1:11:14.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但总是会害怕的 - 这倒是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're never too old to be afraid. - That's true.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.27,1:11:16.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直害怕地下室{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was afraid of our basement.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.39,1:11:19.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,太黑 总觉得有些怪东西在下面 里面的味道也怪怪的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's dark. There's weird stuff down there, and it smells funny.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.90,1:11:23.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样的事烦我好多年了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That sort of thing. It's bothered me for years.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.73,1:11:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,地下室给人的感觉都是那个样子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Basements are like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.24,1:11:28.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,后来我壮着胆子下去洗衣服{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I made myself go down to do some laundry…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.82,1:11:30.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,发觉并不那么可怕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and I found out it's not so bad.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.20,1:11:35.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始我一直很害怕 后来把灯一打开 就什么事都没了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I worried about it, but if you turn on the lights, it's no big deal.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.08,1:11:37.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是什么意思？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your point?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.58,1:11:40.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的意思是 你应该打电话给你儿子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My point is, you should call your son.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.29,1:11:44.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他要是不理我怎么办？- 至少你会知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What if he won't talk to me? - At least you'll know.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.25,1:11:48.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就不必担心这件事了 也就不会再害怕了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you could stop worrying about it. You won't have to be afraid anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.30,1:11:54.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不管多生我爸的气 总会跟他讲话的 特别是在过节的时候{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No matter how mad I was, I'd talk to my dad. Especially around the holidays.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.10,1:11:57.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.89,1:12:01.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你试一试吧 就算是为了你的孙女{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just give it a shot. For your granddaughter anyway.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.14,1:12:04.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我保证她很想你和你的礼物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure she misses you. And the presents.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.94,1:12:06.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我寄过一张支票给她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I send her a check.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.98,1:12:10.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望我爷爷奶奶也寄支票给我 他们总是寄衣服给我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish my grandparents did that. They always send me clothes.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.78,1:12:13.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,去年就给了我一件上面织着大鸟的毛衣{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last year I got a sweater with a bird knitted on it.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.87,1:12:14.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 那不错啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that's nice.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.12,1:12:17.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,二年级的男生不适合穿那个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not for a guy in the second grade.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.45,1:12:20.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是穿了会被打的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can get beat up for wearing something like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.46,1:12:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一个朋友 因为听说他穿过…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a friend who got nailed…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.71,1:12:26.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,有恐龙图案的睡衣 就被打了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…because there was a rumor he wore dinosaur pajamas.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.71,1:12:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还是赶快回家吧 想想我对你说的话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You better run home where you belong. Think about what I said.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.38,1:12:33.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么样？- 好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right? - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.55,1:12:35.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟你聊天真高兴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's nice talking to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.89,1:12:38.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice talking to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.90,1:12:46.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你怎么办？- 我？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What about you? - Me?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.65,1:12:49.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 你和你儿子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. You and your son.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.11,1:12:52.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,再看看吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll see what happens.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.28,1:12:55.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣诞快乐！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Merry Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.74,1:12:58.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣诞快乐！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Merry Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.55,1:13:54.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的房子 我必须保卫它！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my house. I have to defend it.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.63,1:14:02.52,Note,0,0,0,0,,（战略计划图）
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.69,1:14:28.98,Note,0,0,0,0,,（柏油）
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.01,1:15:25.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,先过去看看 然后回来收拾卡车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll check it out. We can come back for the truck.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.52,1:15:34.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们怎么进去？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do we go in?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.28,1:15:38.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,到后门去 也许他会让我们进去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll go to the back door. Maybe he'll let us in.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.40,1:15:41.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 他是个孩子 小孩子都傻{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, he's a kid. Kids are stupid.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.83,1:15:47.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,感谢主赐我营养的微波炉快餐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bless this nutritious, microwaveable macaroni and cheese dinner…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.00,1:15:50.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,并祝福那些低价卖东西的人们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and the people who sold it on sale. Amen.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.86,1:16:18.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样 现在起不再害怕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is it. Don't get scared now.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.75,1:16:34.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣诞快乐 小子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Merry Christmas, little fella.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.34,1:16:40.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们知道你在里面 而且只有你一个人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know that you're in there and that you're all alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:40.55,1:16:42.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 小子 开门！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, come on, kid. Open up.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.76,1:16:46.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,是圣诞老人和小精灵来啦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Santy Claus and his elf.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:48.85,1:16:50.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不会伤害你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We won't hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.73,1:16:54.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不会的 我们还带了礼物来给你呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. Got some nice presents for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.48,1:16:58.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,好孩子 来开门吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be a good little fella now and open the door.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.99,1:17:04.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.95,1:17:07.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? What?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:08.66,1:17:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.87,1:17:12.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么搞的？- 抓住那…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What happened? - Get that little…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.88,1:17:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.02,1:17:33.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了！太好了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes! Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.60,1:17:35.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这兔崽子有枪！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The little jerk is armed!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.31,1:17:39.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我从前门进去 你从地下室进去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it! I'm going in the front. You go down the basement!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.88,1:18:44.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,自作聪明！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That smart aleck!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:12.34,1:20:16.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这小兔崽子 死定了你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, boy. That's it, you little… You little…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.85,1:20:20.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次可不会了 你这个小兔崽子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, not this time, you little brat.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:23.40,1:20:26.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,小混蛋 你在哪？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You little creep, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.22,1:20:51.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得好！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:25.38,1:21:27.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要把你的脑袋扯下来！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…rip his head off…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.05,1:21:38.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你死定了 小子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're dead, kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:25.98,1:22:28.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,小浑蛋 你在哪？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you, you little creep?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.91,1:22:47.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利！我来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Harry, I'm coming in!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.30,1:22:54.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 不 我真的好害怕！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no! I'm really scared.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:54.59,1:22:58.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,太晚了 小子！我们已经在房子里 就要抓到你了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's too late for you, kid, we're in the house. We're gonna get you.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.64,1:23:00.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧！过来抓我吧！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, come and get me!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.10,1:23:02.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why, you…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.77,1:23:10.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你死定了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you're dead!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:35.80,1:23:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我非杀了那小子不可！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna kill that kid!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.31,1:23:55.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 马文 - 哈利！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Marv. - Harry?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.82,1:23:57.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干嘛脱鞋？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why'd you take your shoes off?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.11,1:23:59.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干嘛弄得像只鸡一样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you dressed like a chicken?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.82,1:24:05.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在上面 你们两个白痴 快过来抓我呀！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm up here, you morons. Come and get me.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.62,1:24:11.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们要投降还是要再来一点？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys give up, or are you thirsty for more?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:21.72,1:24:23.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心头！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heads up!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.18,1:24:28.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 马文 我会帮你抓到他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry, Marv. I'll get him for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:32.81,1:24:34.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.03,1:24:41.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不过是个孩子 哈利 我们能抓到他的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's only a kid, Harry. We can take him.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:41.49,1:24:44.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴！你看什么看？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up, will you? What is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:44.82,1:24:46.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你缺牙了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're missing some teeth.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:47.16,1:24:49.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,是哪颗？我的金牙！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where? It's my gold tooth.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.54,1:24:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的金牙没了！我非杀了他不可！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My gold tooth. I'll kill him. I'll kill him!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:54.83,1:24:57.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你再用罐子打…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You bomb me with one more can, kid…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:57.34,1:25:01.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,老子一定把你的小鸡鸡扯下来放在油锅里煎！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and I'll snap off your cojones and boil them in motor oil!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.93,1:25:06.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,911紧急专线{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}911 emergency.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.26,1:25:08.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 有人在我家行窃{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, my house is being robbed.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:08.35,1:25:13.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,地址是林肯大道656号 我的名字叫墨菲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My address is 656 Lincoln Boulevard. My name is Murphy.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:16.52,1:25:17.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道上面有什么东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never know what's there.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.07,1:25:20.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在那里！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There he is!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:25.62,1:25:27.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓到你了！我抓到他了！哈利！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got you! I got him, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.08,1:25:30.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓到了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got him.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:31.50,1:25:32.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利 快起来 帮我！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Harry, give me a hand!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.17,1:25:38.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我抓到他了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got him!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.25,1:25:39.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利 帮我一把！快起来呀！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Harry, help me. Get up!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:41.21,1:25:42.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我抓到他了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got him.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:22.13,1:26:23.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干嘛？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:24.26,1:26:26.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利 不要动！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Harry, don't move.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:27.09,1:26:28.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,马文？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marv?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:28.43,1:26:30.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要动！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't move.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.26,1:26:32.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要干什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:37.56,1:26:39.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,打死了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did I get him?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:39.69,1:26:41.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,打死了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did I get him?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.44,1:26:43.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,在哪里？在哪里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is it? Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.74,1:26:47.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,别管它 爽了没有？你这个浑蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never mind that. Here! How do you like it, huh? You jerk!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.57,1:26:50.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,快去抓那个小孩！快去！抓住他！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get that kid, before I… Get that kid!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:17.10,1:27:18.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑哪去了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where'd he go?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.06,1:27:21.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,说不定自杀了吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe he committed suicide.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:21.48,1:27:26.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,在下面！你们两个大坏蛋 来抓我呀 要不然我报警了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Down here, you big horse's ass! Come get me before I call the police.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:26.49,1:27:28.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我去把这小子抓来！- 等等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's get him! - Wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.70,1:27:30.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这小子就是要我们…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just what he wants us to do:
Dialogue: 0,1:27:30.78,1:27:33.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,从楼下过去中他的机关！想狠狠修理我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go back through his fun house so we get all tore up.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:34.08,1:27:35.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就要报警了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gonna call the cops!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:35.83,1:27:37.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,在树屋怎么报警？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}From a tree house?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:37.75,1:27:38.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:40.12,1:27:41.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,从窗户过去？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out the window?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.88,1:27:43.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not going out the window.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:43.50,1:27:47.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么？你害怕了？你是不是怕了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why, you scared? Are you afraid? Come on, get out here.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.35,1:27:53.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点啦你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:59.69,1:28:01.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点啦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:06.82,1:28:10.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快点！- 哈利 还是回去吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on. Keep going. - Let's go back, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.70,1:28:16.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,马文！别叫啦！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut it, Marv.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.25,1:28:21.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, guys!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:21.87,1:28:23.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,再看看这个！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check this out.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.25,1:28:25.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,快回去！快回去！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go back. Go back.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:14.47,1:29:15.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在那里！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There he is!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.01,1:29:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去报警！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I'm calling the cops!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:19.35,1:29:21.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 他就是想我们跟着他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait! He wants us to follow him.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:22.10,1:29:24.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,看我的 这边走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a better idea. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.04,1:29:43.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 兄弟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, pal.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:43.66,1:29:46.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这回栽在我们手里了吧 过来吧你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We outsmarted you this time. Get over here!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:53.13,1:29:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们怎么修理他？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.72,1:29:56.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,以牙还牙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll do exactly what he did to us.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:56.97,1:29:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要用喷灯烧他的头！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burn his head with a blowtorch.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:59.01,1:30:01.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要用熨斗烫他的脸！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll smash his face with an iron.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:01.22,1:30:04.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,再用油漆桶往他的脸上摔！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like to slap him in the face with a paint can!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:04.27,1:30:05.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不就把钉子插到脚掌里去！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shove a nail through his foot!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:06.15,1:30:11.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他的小嫩手指一根一根咬下来 一次咬一根{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna bite off every one of these little fingers, one at a time.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:20.33,1:30:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走 快回家去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Let's get you home.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:45.69,1:30:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇！这下可好了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow, this is great.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:51.73,1:30:54.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,做得很好 每次做案都放水{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice move, leaving the water running.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:54.24,1:30:58.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在知道了 有水的房子就是你们干的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we know each and every house that you've hit.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:01.53,1:31:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,找你们两个很久了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been looking for you guys for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:04.45,1:31:07.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊 记住了 我们就是有名的「水盗」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Well, remember, we're the Wet Bandits.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:07.71,1:31:11.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们就是水盗 就是流水的水… - 闭嘴！上车！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wet Bandits, that's W-E-T… - Shut up! Get in the car!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:11.88,1:31:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, come on. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:14.30,1:31:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别碰我的头 朋友 - 上车！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hands off the head, pal! - Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:12.40,1:32:14.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是个好母亲 不是好母亲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a bad parent. I'm a bad parent.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:14.57,1:32:15.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你是个好母亲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you're not.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:15.94,1:32:18.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你太自责了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're beating yourself up there.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:18.65,1:32:20.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是常有的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These things happen.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:20.57,1:32:24.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是说起不称职的父母 看看我们吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to talk about bad parents? Look at us.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:24.66,1:32:29.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一年中有48到49个星期在外巡回演出 几乎见不到家人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're on the road 48, 49 weeks a year. We hardly see our families.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:30.12,1:32:32.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,那边的乔治…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Joe, over there. Gosh, you know…
Dialogue: 0,1:32:32.58,1:32:35.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,不记得自己孩子的名字{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…he forgets his kids' names half the time.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:35.63,1:32:38.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,那边的兹吉根本就还没见过自己的孩子呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ziggy over there, he's never even met his kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:39.17,1:32:42.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有艾迪 他对不起家里的事就更多了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddy… Let's just hope none of them write a book about him.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:44.05,1:32:47.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们有因为去度假 把孩子忘在家里吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me, have you gone on vacation and left your child home?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:50.98,1:32:52.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:53.15,1:32:56.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我倒是有一次把孩子忘在殡仪馆了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I did leave one at a funeral parlor once.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:56.86,1:33:00.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,那也是同样让人很难受{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it was terrible too. I was all distraught and everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:00.32,1:33:04.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和我太太把孩子留在殡仪馆了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The wife and I, we left the little tyke there in the funeral parlor.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:04.82,1:33:08.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子被忘在殡仪馆里整整一天 到了晚上…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All day. You know, we went back at night, when we…
Dialogue: 0,1:33:08.70,1:33:10.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,才想起他来 我们赶紧去找他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…came to our senses, there he was.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:11.21,1:33:14.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在遗体旁待了整整一天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apparently, he was there all day with a corpse.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:15.38,1:33:18.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,六七个星期之后 他就好了 你知道的…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was okay. You know, after six, seven weeks.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:18.88,1:33:21.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,就又说又蹦又跳了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He came around and started talking again.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:22.72,1:33:25.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,小孩子很快就恢复了 不像大人那样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They get over it. Kids are resilient like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:25.93,1:33:27.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们或许不应该谈论这个话题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We shouldn't talk about this.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:27.89,1:33:32.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我只是想让你振作起来 - 对不起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I was just trying to cheer you up. - I'm sorry I did.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:58.29,1:33:59.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:04.59,1:34:05.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:09.93,1:34:11.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:58.31,1:34:59.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:01.19,1:35:02.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:33.68,1:35:35.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣诞快乐！宝贝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Merry Christmas, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:44.98,1:35:47.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文 妈妈真的对不起你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Kevin, I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:07.42,1:36:09.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他人都去哪了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's everybody else?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:09.93,1:36:11.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 他们回不来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, baby, they couldn't come.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:12.14,1:36:13.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是想回来的…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They wanted to so much…
Dialogue: 0,1:36:13.60,1:36:18.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才没有流口水呢！有吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't fall asleep in the back and drool all over you, did I?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:18.27,1:36:20.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你流了 - 别吵了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You do drool! - Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:23.44,1:36:27.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文 你还好吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin, my boy. How are you? It's good to see you.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:27.28,1:36:29.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:29.53,1:36:30.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你 你还好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you. You okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:32.41,1:36:33.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Kev.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:35.87,1:36:38.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还没把房子给烧了 真是了不起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's cool that you didn't burn the place down.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:40.87,1:36:42.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 巴兹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, Buzz.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:44.04,1:36:46.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 你们是怎么回来的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute. How'd you guys get home?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:46.25,1:36:48.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们坐的是你不愿意等的那班飞机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the morning flight you didn't want to wait for.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:48.96,1:36:52.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 喔！谢谢 - 圣诞快乐！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, no. Thank you. - Merry Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:52.43,1:36:53.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣诞快乐！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Merry Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:54.47,1:36:56.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁去找间开门的商店{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone has to find an open store.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:56.76,1:36:58.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我昨天去店里买了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I went shopping yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:01.06,1:37:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你？买东西？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, shopping?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:02.90,1:37:05.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我买了牛奶 买了鸡蛋 还有柔软精{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got some milk, eggs and fabric softener.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:07.57,1:37:09.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 真的假的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - No kidding?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:09.65,1:37:11.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这孩子还真好玩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a funny guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:11.57,1:37:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不在家的时候你还做了什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What else did you do while we were away?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:14.87,1:37:17.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是在屋里东摸西摸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just hung around.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:19.20,1:37:20.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,把东西拿上楼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring your stuff upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:20.87,1:37:25.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,买东西？他连自己的鞋带都不会绑 还会买东西？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shopping? He doesn't know how to tie his shoe. He's going shopping?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:25.96,1:37:28.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文才不会这么做呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not the Kevin I knew.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:52.24,1:37:53.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝 这是什么东西？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey, what's this?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:52.25,1:38:55.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文！看你把我的房间搞成什么样子？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin! What did you do to my room?
